<p id="_f30da1ba-1321-f588-5ee7-99685c8f2b7f">The number of features of the feature type that match the selection parameters like  <tt>bbox</tt>.</p>

<p id="_98964e03-ab88-7d2f-39d1-e1d5be91e962">Type: <tt>integer</tt></p>
</clause>

<clause id="_9a2de76d-0262-e9d2-f8f1-458777064567" obligation="normative">
<title id="_382e7e9d-1b37-821e-762b-7ab2f827ffcc">numberReturned</title>
<p id="_b0a23c58-1871-6a19-a80e-b3abf189658f">The number of features in the feature collection.</p>

<p id="_7d64eec3-e497-f8c3-72fb-5401697aeabe">A server may omit this information in a response, if the information about the number of features is not known or difficult to compute.</p>

<p id="_828b5dc0-9ba7-3022-0825-f7596bd8b808">If the value is provided, the value shall be identical to the number of items in the “features” array.</p>

<p id="_0f56b0d6-bc31-f2db-942a-e12ea0665453">Type: <tt>integer</tt></p>
</clause>

